25. Na7 a4 26. Nc6 Bxc6 27. Rxc6 { Now the d6-pawn is a serious target. } Ne8 ( { Or } 27... Rb6 28. Qxb6 $1 Rxb6 29. Rc8 Rb8 30. Rxd8 Rxd8 31. Rc6 { and White is winning at least one pawn. } ) 
28. Nc4 Ra8 ( { Waiting with } 28... Ng6 { is met by } 29. Ra6 { and now the a4-pawn is lost since } Ra8 { loses to } 30. Na5 $1 { . } ) 
